{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cice_coupling",
  "description": "CICE cap-boundary component (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the med<->ice field conversions and the export aggregation of ice_import_export.F90 (cesm3_cice6_6_3_22, cicecore/drivers/nuopc/cmeps/) as algebraic equations, per the stage1/boundaries.md 1.3 boundary table. Imports (med -> ice), exactly ice_import (F90:414-700): the ocean state So_t -> sst, So_s -> sss, So_u/So_v -> uocn/vocn, So_dhdx/So_dhdy -> ss_tltx/ss_tlty (F90:477-482, 610-624); the atmosphere state Sa_z -> zlvl, Sa_tbot -> Tair, Sa_shum -> Qa, Sa_u/Sa_v -> uatm/vatm (F90:487-501, 606-608); the potential-temperature branch Sa_ptem -> potT and Sa_dens -> rhoa when both are present, else the Sa_pbot branch potT = Tair*(100000/pbot)^0.286 and rhoa = pbot/(287.058*(1+0.608*Qa)*Tair) with the Fortran's zero/1.2 fallbacks (F90:503-515, 655-681); the flux imports Fioo_q -> frzmlt, Faxa_swvdr/swndr/swvdf/swndf -> swvdr/swidr/swvdf/swidf, Faxa_lwdn -> flw, Faxa_rain -> frain, Faxa_snow -> fsnow, each multiplied by med2mod_areacor (F90:529-575) with frain converted kg/m2/s -> m/s by rhofresh for the melt-pond consumption (icepack_meltpond_lvl.F90:160). Exports (ice -> med), exactly ice_export (F90:1030-1317) and the merge_fluxes aggregation of icepack_flux.F90:180-260: the ice-fraction scaling ailohi = min(aice, 1) (F90:949) and the state fields Si_ifrac, Si_t = Tffresh + sum_n(Tsfc*aicen)/ailohi (F90:950-951; the trcr(:,nt_Tsfc) aggregate of icepack_aggregate), Si_avsdr/anidr/avsdf/anidf = sum_n(albedo*aicen) (direct = diffuse under the ccsm3 shortwave scheme, icepack_shortwave.F90:568-572), Si_vice = sum_n vicen, Si_vsno = sum_n vsnon, Si_snowh = vsno/ailohi for ailohi > 0 (F90:1121-1129); the air-ice fluxes Faii_taux/tauy = strairxT/strairyT (the T-point atmo stress of the constant boundary-layer scheme, F90:962-964), Faii_lat/sen = sum_n(flatn/fsensn*aicen) (icepack_flux.F90:204-206), Faii_lwup = sum_n((flwoutn-(1-emissivity)*flw)*aicen) with the outgoing-longwave fix -stefan_boltzmann*(Tf+Tffresh)^4/ailohi where flwout > -puny (F90:213-215, 1149-1164), Faii_evap = sum_n(evapn*aicen), Faii_swnet = sum_n(swabs*aicen); and the ice-ocean fluxes Fioi_swpen = sum_n(fswthru*aicen) (F90:247), Fioi_melth = sum_n(fhocnn*aicen), Fioi_meltw = sum_n(freshn*aicen), Fioi_salt = sum_n(fsaltn*aicen), Fioi_taux/tauy = -strocnxT/strocnyT (F90:966-968, the sign flip of the ice-into-ocean stress convention). All Faii_*/Fioi_* exports carry mod2med_areacor (state_setexport areacor, F90:1051-1317); the Si_* state exports do not. The wave (Si_thick, Si_floediam), aerosol (Fioi_bcpho/bcphi, Fioi_flxdst), isotope (Fioi_meltw_wiso, Faii_evap_wiso, Si_qref_wiso), and per-band penetration (Fioi_swpen_vdr/vdf/idr/idf) exports are deferred and carried as zero parameters; the reference-height exports Si_u10/Si_tref/Si_qref are zero under the transcribed constant atmbndy scheme (atmo_boundary_const does not compute Tref/Qref/Uref; the similarity scheme is deferred). The POP-grid rotation of tauxa/tauya/tauxo/tauyo (ANGLET, F90:962-968) and the tmask ocean-mask guards collapse to the identity on the single-cell skeleton and are documented in the descriptions. The Tf ocean freezing temperature is the tfrz_option = 'mushy' liquidus of icepack_sea_freezing_temperature (icepack_therm_shared.F90:404-406) via the shared template. The tests block is empty pending the stage-1 instrumentation dumps (stage1/dumps/cice/). Reference: stage1/cesm/components/cice/src/cicecore/drivers/nuopc/cmeps/ice_import_export.F90."
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "ncat": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_CAT"
  }
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "N_CAT": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 5,
   "description": "number of ice thickness categories (namelist ncat = 5), [-]"
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "IceCap": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "./cice_templates.esm"
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "zlvl": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "atmosphere level height above the surface (import Sa_z, ice_import_export.F90:487-489, 590-591), [m]"
    },
    "Tair": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "air temperature at the lowest model level (import Sa_tbot, F90:500-501), [K]"
    },
    "Qa": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "air specific humidity at the lowest model level (import Sa_shum, F90:505-506), [kg/kg]"
    },
    "sst": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "degC",
     "description": "sea surface temperature (import So_t, F90:477-478, 580-581; degC internally, Tffresh added where Kelvin is needed), [C]"
    },
    "sss": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "ppt",
     "description": "sea surface salinity (import So_s, F90:480-481, 583-584), [ppt]"
    },
    "uocn": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "ocean surface current, x (import So_u, F90:605-606), [m/s]"
    },
    "vocn": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "ocean surface current, y (import So_v), [m/s]"
    },
    "uatm": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "x wind velocity at zlvl (import Sa_u, F90:607-608; on the T grid, rotated to the model grid by ANGLET in prepare_forcing, ice_forcing.F90:1800-1807 - the identity on the single-cell skeleton), [m/s]"
    },
    "vatm": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "y wind velocity at zlvl (import Sa_v), [m/s]"
    },
    "ss_tltx": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "x sea-surface slope for the coupled tilt stress (import So_dhdx, F90:608-609), [-]"
    },
    "ss_tlty": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "y sea-surface slope (import So_dhdy), [-]"
    },
    "frzmlt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "ocean-to-ice heat flux available for bottom melt (import Fioo_q, the SOM 'freezing-melting' flux, F90:529-532, times med2mod_areacor), [W/m2]"
    },
    "swvdr": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "downward shortwave, visible, direct (import Faxa_swvdr, F90:534-537, times med2mod_areacor), [W/m2]"
    },
    "swidr": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "downward shortwave, near-IR, direct (import Faxa_swndr, F90:538-541), [W/m2]"
    },
    "swvdf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "downward shortwave, visible, diffuse (import Faxa_swvdf, F90:542-545), [W/m2]"
    },
    "swidf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "downward shortwave, near-IR, diffuse (import Faxa_swndf, F90:546-549), [W/m2]"
    },
    "flw": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "downward longwave radiation (import Faxa_lwdn, F90:550-553, times med2mod_areacor), [W/m2]"
    },
    "frain": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "rainfall rate in m/s: the cap Faxa_rain kg/m2/s field times med2mod_areacor divided by rhofresh = 1000 (the melt-pond code consumes frain in m/s via the frain*dt term, icepack_meltpond_lvl.F90:160), [m/s]"
    },
    "fsnow": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^2/s",
     "description": "snowfall rate (import Faxa_snow, F90:558-561, times med2mod_areacor; kg/m2/s is what the thermodynamics consumes; the new-snow thickness is fsnow*dt/rhos, icepack_therm_vertical.F90:1640-1650), [kg/m2/s]"
    },
    "potT": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "air potential temperature: the Sa_ptem import when Sa_ptem and Sa_dens are present (F90:503-508, 655-656); else the Sa_pbot branch potT = Tair*(100000/pbot)^0.286 when the pressure is positive, else 0 (F90:660-668), [K]"
    },
    "rhoa": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^3",
     "description": "air density: the Sa_dens import when present (F90:503-508, 657); else the Sa_pbot branch rhoa = pbot/(287.058*(1+0.608*Qa)*Tair) when Tair /= 0, else 1.2 (F90:669-679), [kg/m3]"
    },
    "Tf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "degC",
     "description": "ocean freezing temperature under tfrz_option = 'mushy' (icepack_sea_freezing_temperature, icepack_therm_shared.F90:404-406; the Assur-1958 liquidus of icepack_mushy_physics.F90:227-261), used by the Faii_lwup fix, [C]"
    },
    "aice": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "aggregate ice concentration aice = sum_n aicen (icepack_aggregate; the coupling ice fraction of ice_state%aice), [-]"
    },
    "vice": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "aggregate ice volume per unit grid-cell area vice = sum_n vicen, [m]"
    },
    "vsno": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "aggregate snow volume per unit grid-cell area vsno = sum_n vsnon, [m]"
    },
    "ailohi": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "ice area for the coupler scaling: ailohi = min(aice, 1) (ice_import_export.F90:949), [-]"
    },
    "Tsrf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "ice surface temperature in Kelvin, the trcr(:,nt_Tsfc) aggregate: Tsrf = Tffresh + sum_n(Tsfc*aicen)/ailohi (F90:950-951; icepack_aggregate), [K]"
    },
    "alvdr": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "aggregate visible-direct albedo Si_avsdr = sum_n(alvdrn*aicen) (merge_fluxes/icepack_aggregate; direct = diffuse under the ccsm3 scheme, icepack_shortwave.F90:568-572), [-]"
    },
    "alidr": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "aggregate near-IR-direct albedo Si_anidr = sum_n(alidrn*aicen), [-]"
    },
    "alvdf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "aggregate visible-diffuse albedo Si_avsdf = sum_n(alvdfn*aicen), [-]"
    },
    "alidf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "aggregate near-IR-diffuse albedo Si_anidf = sum_n(alidfn*aicen), [-]"
    },
    "fsens": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "aggregate sensible heat flux Faii_sen = sum_n(fsensn*aicen) (merge_fluxes, icepack_flux.F90:204), [W/m2]"
    },
    "flat": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "aggregate latent heat flux Faii_lat = sum_n(flatn*aicen) (icepack_flux.F90:206), [W/m2]"
    },
    "fswabs": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "aggregate shortwave absorbed in ice and ocean Faii_swnet = sum_n(swabs*aicen) (icepack_flux.F90:210), [W/m2]"
    },
    "flwout": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "aggregate outgoing longwave: flwout = sum_n((flwoutn-(1-emissivity)*flw)*aicen) (icepack_flux.F90:213-215; emissivity = 0.985), [W/m2]"
    },
    "evap": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^2/s",
     "description": "aggregate evaporative water flux Faii_evap = sum_n(evapn*aicen) (icepack_flux.F90:219), [kg/m2/s]"
    },
    "fhocn": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "aggregate net heat flux to the ocean Fioi_melth = sum_n(fhocnn*aicen) (icepack_flux.F90:253), [W/m2]"
    },
    "fresh": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^2/s",
     "description": "aggregate fresh-water flux to the ocean Fioi_meltw = sum_n(freshn*aicen) (icepack_flux.F90:255), [kg/m2/s]"
    },
    "fsalt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^2/s",
     "description": "aggregate salt flux to the ocean Fioi_salt = sum_n(fsaltn*aicen) (icepack_flux.F90:257), [kg/m2/s]"
    },
    "Si_ifrac": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "ice fraction sent to the mediator: Si_ifrac = ailohi (ice_import_export.F90:1044-1045), [-]"
    },
    "Si_t": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "surface temperature of the ice-covered portion in Kelvin: Si_t = Tsrf (F90:1073-1074; the state_setexport ifrac=ailohi scaling divides by the ice fraction on the mediator side), [K]"
    },
    "Si_avsdr": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "visible-direct albedo state export Si_avsdr = alvdr (F90:1077-1078), [-]"
    },
    "Si_anidr": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "near-IR-direct albedo state export Si_anidr = alidr (F90:1081-1082), [-]"
    },
    "Si_avsdf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "visible-diffuse albedo state export Si_avsdf = alvdf (F90:1085-1086), [-]"
    },
    "Si_anidf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "near-IR-diffuse albedo state export Si_anidf = alidf (F90:1089-1090), [-]"
    },
    "Si_vsno": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "snow volume state export Si_vsno = vsno (F90:1105-1106), [m]"
    },
    "Si_vice": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "ice volume state export Si_vice = vice (F90:1109-1110), [m]"
    },
    "Si_snowh": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "snow depth over the ice-covered area: Si_snowh = vsno/ailohi for ailohi > 0, else 0 (F90:1121-1129), [m]"
    },
    "Faii_taux": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "description": "zonal air-ice stress export: Faii_taux = strairxT*mod2med_areacor (F90:1052-1057; the Fortran rotates the T-point stress to lat-lon with ANGLET, F90:962-964 - the identity on the single-cell skeleton), [N/m2]"
    },
    "Faii_tauy": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "description": "meridional air-ice stress export: Faii_tauy = strairyT*mod2med_areacor (F90:1058-1063), [N/m2]"
    },
    "Faii_lat": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "latent heat flux export Faii_lat = flat*mod2med_areacor (F90:1064-1069), [W/m2]"
    },
    "Faii_sen": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "sensible heat flux export Faii_sen = fsens*mod2med_areacor (F90:1070-1075), [W/m2]"
    },
    "Faii_lwup": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "outgoing longwave export Faii_lwup = flwout*mod2med_areacor with the fix: where flwout > -puny the Fortran substitutes -stefan_boltzmann*(Tf+Tffresh)^4/ailohi (F90:1149-1164, the aice_init = 0 case; tmask guard dropped on the single-cell skeleton), [W/m2]"
    },
    "Faii_evap": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^2/s",
     "description": "evaporative water flux export Faii_evap = evap*mod2med_areacor (F90:1166-1171), [kg/m2/s]"
    },
    "Faii_swnet": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "shortwave absorbed in ice and ocean export Faii_swnet = fswabs*mod2med_areacor (F90:1172-1177), [W/m2]"
    },
    "Fioi_swpen": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "shortwave through the ice to the ocean export Fioi_swpen = fswthru*mod2med_areacor (F90:1180-1185), [W/m2]"
    },
    "Fioi_melth": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "heat flux to the ocean export Fioi_melth = fhocn*mod2med_areacor (F90:1222-1227), [W/m2]"
    },
    "Fioi_meltw": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^2/s",
     "description": "fresh-water flux to the ocean export Fioi_meltw = fresh*mod2med_areacor (F90:1228-1233), [kg/m2/s]"
    },
    "Fioi_salt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^2/s",
     "description": "salt flux to the ocean export Fioi_salt = fsalt*mod2med_areacor (F90:1234-1239), [kg/m2/s]"
    },
    "Fioi_taux": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "description": "zonal ice-ocean stress export: Fioi_taux = -strocnxT*mod2med_areacor (F90:1240-1245; the Fortran's tauxo = -strocnxT_iavg, the T-point average of the U-point stress strocnxU/aiU of step_dyn_horiz, ice_step_mod.F90:1051-1072, rotated with ANGLET - the single-cell skeleton collapses the X2Y mapping and consumes the dynamics component's full ocean stress taux of dyn_finish, ice_dyn_shared.F90:1345-1348), [N/m2]"
    },
    "Fioi_tauy": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "description": "meridional ice-ocean stress export: Fioi_tauy = -strocnyT*mod2med_areacor (F90:1246-1251), [N/m2]"
    },
    "Sa_z": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 10.0,
     "description": "atmosphere reference height of the lowest model level (CMEPS Sa_z, m), [m]"
    },
    "Sa_tbot": {
